[Music]  have you ever wondered which kaiju is  the biggest  there have been many that have crossed  the 100 meters height benchmark  and some even touching 150 meters tall  of course godzilla earth  comes to mind since he was more than 300  meters or a thousand feet tall  as well as his arch rival the  trans-dimensional ghidorah  which would easily take the first place  as he was tens of kilometers long  but ghidorah in this form is kind of  ethereal and intangible  so let us get past this one and look at  another kaiju that was far bigger than  even godzilla earth  and this one only appeared in the idw  comics godzilla rulers of earth  and the final issue relatively unknown  this alien kaiju dwarfed the rest of the  monsters of earth  making them look tiny in comparison  majita is the name of the giant trilobot  kaiju that was featured in the final  issue of godzilla rulers of earth  well what are these parts they are a  species of power absorbing alien  creatures which first appeared  in issue 19 of those comics they are the  first completely new major monsters to  appear in any of idw's godzilla comic  series  they are ultimate biological weapons of  the cry of aliens and these  triloports were deployed to earth to  conquer and subdue it  these vicious creatures proved more than  a match for earth's kaiju  stealing their powers and gradually  trapping them within a colossal hive in  los angeles  the tripods managed to even bring down  godzilla himself  the triloport's general physical  appearance is much like that of real  arthropods  these tripods have trilobite-like shells  and belly flaps  lined with sharp teeth and radial mouths  and sharp arm-like  sights with red spheres while all the  base trailer ports share common features  the beta teleports are taller than their  alpha counterparts  and stand upright mostly so that they  can fight other kaiju using their  massive sights but the most outstanding  feature is their ability to absorb and  mimic the powers  and appearances of other kaijus while  most of these alpha and beta types of  the tripods can  mimic and reach the sizes of other kaiju  there is one king called majita that was  bigger  than everything else in the entire  continuity majita is very similar in  appearance to its beta trilogy brethren  but it is considerably more massive and  completely dwarves godzilla and his  allies  majita possesses several more paddy pops  on its head than the other trailer ports  as well as dozens of circular glowing  patches on the sides of its neck  majita's arms are very long and are  tipped with sharp spikes  it was also named the trailer god or the  king of the trello ports  magetta did not display any notable  abilities during its sole appearance  however due to its incredible size it is  able to withstand all physical attacks  from other kaiju  and swat its enemies about with ease but  it was completely destroyed when  godzilla unleashed a nuclear pulse  from inside its mouth well let's look  into its size  even though an exact measurement of its  height was never released  this trailer guard is easily one of the  largest kaiju in the godzilla franchise  if not the largest standing many times  taller than godzilla and the other  monsters  it fought according to the main artist  for godzilla rulers of earth  matt frank magita is roughly the same  size as the magnetic monster from  the hannah barbara godzilla cartoon at  its maximum height which  stood several times godzilla's height  when asked about magetta's height  in comparison to the 300 meter tall  godzilla earth  he said that vegeta is 500 meters tall  while chris mori another one  stated that vegeta was at least eight  times the size of biollante  so around 960 meters in height by those  statements we can see that vegeta was  almost twice as tall as godzilla earth  if we take matt frank's statement and  more than three times taller if we go by  chris morris estimate  that would mean that the monsters of  earth were standing at its feet  no wonder they were not able to  physically harm it and only godzilla's  ultimate nuclear pulse inside its mouth  was able to finally defeat this titanic  kaiju otherwise its armor was  impenetrable  and none of the earth's kaiju's attacks  and even space godzilla  had any effect on it by the way in this  battle  both godzilla and space godzilla arched  enemies of each other  were forced to fight together against  the trilobots  now if some of you are still thinking as  to how the trailer ports absorb power  and how they were able to mimic the  monsters then let me finish  this video with this there are two types  of strider ports  other than magetta there are the smaller  alpha trailer ports which were six  legged and crawl on the ground  then there are the beta teleports which  stood by peel and were bigger in size  the ability to absorb power and  transform is a two-stage process  involving both trilobots first and alpha  must pierce the skin of a kaiju  to absorb its energy then climb onto the  back of a beta transport  and merge with it the resulting creature  will have both the powers and physical  characteristics of the target kaiju  this includes energy attacks like  godzilla's atomic breath and even space  godzilla's telekinesis and crystal  generation  and so with that we come to the end of  the video about the triloports and the  biggest kaiju majita  which was again way bigger than godzilla  earth like comparing a dog with a rhino  so subscribe and hit that bell button  for regular notifications  on our future videos take care fam

